#: ../../tokens.md:1
msgid "Tokens and languages"
msgstr "Tokeni na lugha"

#: ../../tokens.md:3
msgid ""
"Models do not read words. They read tokens, which are pieces of text. You"
" pay for tokens, your `max_tokens` limit is measured in tokens, and "
"longer token counts take longer to process. So it helps to know how many "
"tokens your text will use before you send it."
msgstr ""
"Model hazisomi maneno. Zinasoma tokeni, ambazo ni vipande vya maandishi. "
"Unalipia tokeni, kikomo chako cha `max_tokens` hupimwa kwa tokeni, na idadi"
" kubwa ya tokeni huchukua muda mrefu zaidi kuchakatwa. Kwa hiyo, ni muhimu"
" kujua maandishi yako yatatumia tokeni ngapi kabla ya kuyatuma."

#: ../../tokens.md:5
msgid "Why the same idea can cost different amounts"
msgstr "Kwa nini wazo lilelile linaweza kutumia kiasi tofauti"

#: ../../tokens.md:7
msgid ""
"A tokenizer that was built mostly around English text often cuts words "
"from other languages into more pieces. The same sentence in two languages"
" can therefore use a different number of tokens, even when the meaning is"
" identical. If you build for several languages, check token counts for "
"each one instead of assuming they match."
msgstr ""
"Tokenizer iliyoundwa hasa kwa maandishi ya Kiingereza mara nyingi hugawanya"
" maneno ya lugha nyingine kuwa vipande vingi zaidi. Kwa hiyo, sentensi ile"
" ile katika lugha mbili inaweza kutumia idadi tofauti ya tokeni, hata kama"
" maana yake ni ileile. Ikiwa unatengeneza kwa ajili ya lugha kadhaa, "
"angalia idadi ya tokeni kwa kila lugha badala ya kudhani zinafanana."

#: ../../tokens.md:9
msgid "Count tokens before you send"
msgstr "Hesabu tokeni kabla ya kutuma"

#: ../../tokens.md:11
msgid "`POST /v1/tokens/count` returns the token count for a piece of text."
msgstr "`POST /v1/tokens/count` hurudisha idadi ya tokeni kwa kipande cha maandishi."

#: ../../tokens.md:14
msgid ""
"Lugha uses a deliberately simple tokenizer. It cuts every word into "
"pieces of at most four characters. That makes results easy to explain and"
" reproduce. It does not describe how any real model counts tokens, so "
"treat the numbers below as a demonstration of the endpoint, not a "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"Lugha hutumia tokenizer rahisi kwa makusudi. Hugawanya kila neno kuwa "
"vipande vyenye upeo wa herufi nne. Hii hufanya matokeo yawe rahisi "
"kueleza na kurudia. Haielezi jinsi model halisi inavyohesabu tokeni, hivyo"
" chukulia nambari zilizo hapa chini kama onyesho la endpoint, si kipimo."

#: ../../tokens.md:17
msgid "Count an English sentence:"
msgstr "Hesabu tokeni za sentensi ya Kiingereza:"

#: ../../tokens.md:30
msgid "Now a Swahili sentence:"
msgstr "Sasa sentensi ya Kiswahili:"

#: ../../tokens.md:43
msgid "`token_count`"
msgstr "`token_count`"

#: ../../tokens.md:44
msgid "The number of tokens in the text."
msgstr "Idadi ya tokeni katika maandishi."

#: ../../tokens.md:46
msgid "`word_count`"
msgstr "`word_count`"

#: ../../tokens.md:47
msgid "The number of words, split on whitespace."
msgstr "Idadi ya maneno, yaliyogawanywa kwa nafasi."

#: ../../tokens.md:49
msgid "`tokens_per_word`"
msgstr "`tokens_per_word`"

#: ../../tokens.md:50
msgid ""
"`token_count` divided by `word_count`, rounded to two decimals. Use it to"
" compare texts of different lengths."
msgstr ""
"`token_count` ikigawanywa kwa `word_count`, na matokeo yakizungushwa hadi "
"desimali mbili. Itumie kulinganisha maandishi yenye urefu tofauti."

#: ../../tokens.md:52
msgid "How tokens show up elsewhere"
msgstr "Jinsi tokeni zinavyoonekana sehemu nyingine"

#: ../../tokens.md:54
msgid ""
"The `usage` object in a `/v1/generate` response reports the same counts "
"for a real request: `prompt_tokens` for what you sent and "
"`completion_tokens` for what came back."
msgstr ""
"Object ya `usage` katika response ya `/v1/generate` huripoti idadi hiyo "
"kwa request halisi: `prompt_tokens` kwa ulichotuma na `completion_tokens` "
"kwa kilichorudishwa."

#: ../../tokens.md:56
msgid ""
"`max_tokens` limits `completion_tokens` only. It does not include your "
"prompt. If the model reaches the limit, the response ends with "
"`finish_reason` set to `length`."
msgstr ""
"`max_tokens` inaweka kikomo kwa `completion_tokens` pekee. Haijumuishi "
"prompt yako. Model ikifikia kikomo, response huisha huku `finish_reason` "
"ikiwa imewekwa kuwa `length`."

#: ../../tokens.md:58
msgid ""
"Count your prompt first if you want to estimate the size of a request "
"before you make it."
msgstr ""
"Hesabu prompt yako kwanza ikiwa unataka kukadiria ukubwa wa request kabla "
"ya kuituma."